#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:2056
msgid ""
"Quality is used to determine quality of image uploads, and ranges from 0 "
"(worst quality, smaller file) to 100 (best quality, biggest file). The "
"default range is 60."
msgstr ""
"کیفیت برای تعیین کیفیت آپلودهای تصویر استفاده می‌شود و از 0 (بدترین کیفیت، "
